scenario: SND-EAR-03
title: Choose between two outputs
area: Sound
rows: F-SND-01, F-SND-02
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Two outputs are available, for example the built-in speakers and headphones or an HDMI screen with speakers.
step: Open Settings, Sound and read the list of outputs.
expect: Every output you can see on the machine is listed, each with a plain name (no raw card numbers only).
clause: F-SND-02.list
step: Choose the first output and press Play test tone.
expect: The tone comes out of that output only.
clause: F-SND-02.first
step: Choose the second output and press Play test tone.
expect: The tone moves to the second output and the first is silent.
clause: F-SND-02.second
step: Restart the computer (Power menu, Restart), sign in and play the test tone again.
expect: The second output is still the chosen one and the tone comes out of it.
clause: F-SND-01.remembered
